움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">미복학 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">자격 제한</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -41pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정이 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학사경고로 제적된 후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이 경과되지 아니한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;→ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학사경고제적 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 경과 후 재입학 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수학능력과 수업태도 등 학업활동을 계속할 수 없다고 판단되는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">재입학 사실이 있는 자 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">→ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">재입학은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">회에 한함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-fam